{
  "body0": "Reduced to observables, the driver is this — every neutral broker who touched this dispute has since recused or vanished. Tau Reticuli Cohort versus Tau Reticuli Service is the headline; the secular decline in conditions at Atlas-Bridge II is the data. The principals are the failed terraforming biosphere and Catalog Authority; the measurable damage accumulates at Tau Reticuli Trust. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: the insurers have quietly reclassified everything near Failed terraforming biosphere. Rebuild crews work the damaged ring under floodlights, around the clock, without press. The medical chirality stock applies pressure along every administrative axis; Atlas-Bridge VII Station 18 damps what it can. Every model of the dispute shares one input: redundancy was cut three budgets ago and never restored. Both sides run ferries past the wreck site, and both slow down without announcing why. And The audit trail for Atlas-Bridge II is complete, consistent, and custodied entirely by Tau Reticuli Service.",
